            "description": "<p><strong>HOW: </strong>Take a pump of product, gently massage onto wet skin, rinse off with water & pat dry.<br/><br/><strong>WHERE: </strong>Face & Neck<br/><br/><strong>WHEN: </strong>AM and PM</p>"
