            "description": "<p><strong>HOW:</strong> Apply a few drops evenly on clean skin, with your fingertips. Avoid touching the glass dropper directly to your skin.<br/><br/><strong>WHEN: </strong>PM (1-2 times a week) <br/>*Do not apply correcting concentrate in the same routine<br/><br/><strong>WHERE: </strong>Face & Neck</p>"
